<div class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand-500 mb-3"><%= gettext("Explore") %></div>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-on-surface mb-4"><%= gettext("Why Elixir?") %></h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-on-surface-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <%= gettext("Elixir is a wonderful language but don't take our word for it. Let's look at some of the reasons you and your organization should adopt Elixir.") %>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Functional Programming -->
    <div class="bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle rounded-design-lg p-8 sm:p-10 mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface mb-4"><%= gettext("Functional Programming") %></h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-secondary mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        <%= gettext("While its roots are in lambda calculus, functional programming can be fun, easy, and approachable for everyone! By focusing on breaking problems down into simple, side-effect free, functions we can ensure fewer bugs, better test coverage, while incrementally building our solutions through the composition of well tested functions.") %>
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Immutability") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("Data is not mutated, rather transformed, into a new set of data.") %>
            <%= gettext("By eliminating the ability to mutate state outside of scope, functional programs are often easier to follow and contain fewer bugs.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Focus on Functions") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("Problems are decomposed into simple functions with an emphasis on no side-effects.") %>
            <%= gettext("These \"pure functions\" always produce the same results for a given input and change nothing.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Easy to Test") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("The very nature of functional programming, small functions with no side-effects, makes testing easy.") %>
            <%= gettext("Bundled with Elixir is the venerable ExUnit library providing everything necessary to comprehensively test your applications.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature Packed -->
    <div class="bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle rounded-design-lg p-8 sm:p-10 mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface mb-4"><%= gettext("Feature Packed") %></h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-secondary mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        <%= gettext("Elixir and the BEAM virtual machine pack a serious punch when it comes to features. With over 35 years of experience the Erlang runtime system has proven itself time and time again as solid platform for distributed, high-available systems.") %>
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <%= for feature <- [gettext("Scalable"), gettext("Fault Tolerant"), gettext("Extensible"), gettext("Compatible with Erlang"), gettext("Concurrency"), gettext("Performant")] do %>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-heading font-semibold text-on-surface"><%= feature %></span>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vibrant Ecosystem -->
    <div class="bg-surface-card border border-border-subtle rounded-design-lg p-8 sm:p-10">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface mb-4"><%= gettext("Vibrant Ecosystem") %></h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-secondary mb-8 max-w-3xl">
        <%= gettext("The community and ecosystem that have grown up with the language remain one of the alluring parts of Elixir.") %>
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Slack") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("The Elixir Slack is a popular destination for many in the community.") %>
            <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://elixir-slackin.herokuapp.com/" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors"><%= gettext("Request your invite today!") %></a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Discord") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("A Slack alternative built with Elixir is fast becoming a popular chat option for the community.") %>
            <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://discord.com/invite/elixir" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors"><%= gettext("Be sure to check it out!") %></a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Forum") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("Prefer the forum format for your questions? No problem! Head over to") %> <a class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors" href="https://elixirforum.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= gettext("Elixir Forum") %></a> <%= gettext("to join the conversation.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Meetups") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("With over 150 meetups, you're sure to find local Elixir enthusiasts. Check out") %> <a href="https://www.meetup.com/topics/elixir/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">Meetup.com</a> <%= gettext("for more.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Hashtags") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("Be sure to follow the popular Elixir hashtags") %> <a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/MyElixirStatus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">#MyElixirStatus</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/WeBEAMTogether" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">#WeBEAMTogether</a>, <%= gettext("and") %> <a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/ElixirLang" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">#Elixirlang</a> <%= gettext("on Twitter.") %>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-secondary rounded-design-md p-6">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2"><%= gettext("Conferences") %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-secondary leading-relaxed">
            <%= gettext("More to come...") %>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
